  "body_html": "<p>The story about the bum who finds a black suitcase full of money already turned itself into a city legend. Watch a sleek, indie interpretation of it in John Rambo’s short movie “Bum Luck”.</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/SWYv90O7_OU\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\n<p>Starring my friend William Rivera as the main character.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/maxresdefault.jpg\"><img alt=\"maxresdefault\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-3309\" height=\"247\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/maxresdefault-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"440\"/></a></p>",
